0..70 Comment "// This manifold places the older role at the newer site under `Path`."
71..73 Comment "//"
74..147 Comment "// A translation is code at a site\'s boundary, so the manifold states the"
148..173 Comment "// policy that admits it."
174..176 Comment "//"
177..253 Comment "// `Path` admits a translation each of whose members renames one member: the"
254..331 Comment "// renaming at `store`, and the flow `downgrade` at `cache`. The check writes"
332..406 Comment "// the site\'s module through each translation, and takes the result at the"
407..426 Comment "// older signature."
427..429 Comment "//"
430..485 Comment "// - see: `translated.gandr` — the program it deploys"
486..546 Comment "// - see: `translated.site.gandr` — the site `far` runs at"
